; TinyDev-Scout.cd - catalog description of TinyDev-Scout's window (built-in language: english)
;
; Format of CatComp/FlexCat; amiga-devkit/tools/catcomp.py makes
; scout_strings.h and the catalogs. Keep the format specifiers and
; the '_' shortcuts unique in every language. Scout's ARexx results
; and messages in the Shell stay English.
;
